# The Server settings section "Sharing and invitations" (ADR 0024 §Share codes, §Invitations; ADR
# 0026 shapes). Only a ServerAdmin reads or changes these settings, and never from a session on a
# TV. A change applies to what is issued after it.

"""
How long a share code stays live after it is issued, unless an offer spends it or it is withdrawn
first. Only a ServerAdmin reads or changes it. A change applies to codes issued after it.
"""
type ShareCodeLifetimeSetting {
    "The same for every read and change, so a client cache can update the setting in place."
    id: ID!
    "How long, in hours, a code issued now stays live. Only a ServerAdmin reads it."
    hours: Int!
    "The shortest lifetime a ServerAdmin can choose."
    minimumHours: Int!
    "The longest lifetime a ServerAdmin can choose."
    maximumHours: Int!
}

"Only a ServerAdmin may change the share code lifetime."
input ChangeShareCodeLifetimeInput {
    "How long a code issued from now on stays live, from minimumHours to maximumHours."
    hours: Int!
}

"The answer to a ServerAdmin's change of the share code lifetime."
type ChangeShareCodeLifetimePayload {
    "The setting as changed. Null when the change is refused."
    shareCodeLifetimeSetting: ShareCodeLifetimeSetting
    "Why the change was refused. Empty when the setting changed."
    userErrors: [ChangeShareCodeLifetimeError!]!
}

"Why a ServerAdmin's change of the share code lifetime was refused."
union ChangeShareCodeLifetimeError = LifetimeOutOfRangeError

"""
How long an Account invitation, a ProfileManager invitation, or an offer of a Profile waits for its
answer after it is made. Only a ServerAdmin reads or changes it. A change applies to what is issued
after it.
"""
type InvitationLifetimeSetting {
    "The same for every read and change, so a client cache can update the setting in place."
    id: ID!
    "How long, in hours, what is issued now waits for its answer. Only a ServerAdmin reads it."
    hours: Int!
    "The shortest lifetime a ServerAdmin can choose."
    minimumHours: Int!
    "The longest lifetime a ServerAdmin can choose."
    maximumHours: Int!
}

"Only a ServerAdmin may change the invitation lifetime."
input ChangeInvitationLifetimeInput {
    "How long what is issued from now on waits for its answer, from minimumHours to maximumHours."
    hours: Int!
}

"The answer to a ServerAdmin's change of the invitation lifetime."
type ChangeInvitationLifetimePayload {
    "The setting as changed. Null when the change is refused."
    invitationLifetimeSetting: InvitationLifetimeSetting
    "Why the change was refused. Empty when the setting changed."
    userErrors: [ChangeInvitationLifetimeError!]!
}

"Why a ServerAdmin's change of the invitation lifetime was refused."
union ChangeInvitationLifetimeError = LifetimeOutOfRangeError

"""
How many live share codes a Household may hold at once. At the limit, issuing another answers
ShareCodeLimitReachedError. Only a ServerAdmin reads or changes it. A lower limit ends no live code:
it refuses the next issue until the Household holds fewer codes than the limit.
"""
type ShareCodeLimitSetting {
    "The same for every read and change, so a client cache can update the setting in place."
    id: ID!
    "How many live share codes a Household may hold now. Only a ServerAdmin reads it."
    codes: Int!
    "The lowest limit a ServerAdmin can choose."
    minimumCodes: Int!
    "The highest limit a ServerAdmin can choose."
    maximumCodes: Int!
}

"Only a ServerAdmin may change the share code limit."
input ChangeShareCodeLimitInput {
    "How many live share codes a Household may hold, from minimumCodes to maximumCodes."
    codes: Int!
}

"The answer to a ServerAdmin's change of the share code limit."
type ChangeShareCodeLimitPayload {
    "The setting as changed. Null when the change is refused."
    shareCodeLimitSetting: ShareCodeLimitSetting
    "Why the change was refused. Empty when the setting changed."
    userErrors: [ChangeShareCodeLimitError!]!
}

"Why a ServerAdmin's change of the share code limit was refused."
union ChangeShareCodeLimitError = ShareCodeLimitOutOfRangeError
